TIP:  The intro is four measures of (A) and you can play them just like that but in the last strum of the second measure there's a subtle accent of the treble <e> so just reach down and pick the open 1st string using an upstroke pick.

TIP:  Doesn't really matter if you play an (E) where you see the (E7).  Play all (E)s if you want, the (E7) just gives it a little color.
  

